  "content": "<p>本模组属于[Dungeons and Taverns](<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-and-taverns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-and-taverns</a>)系列，但<b>无需</b>安装Dungeons and Taverns主模组即可运行。请注意，Dungeons and Taverns主模组<b>并不包含</b>本模组的特性。若您想获取更多类似结构，请查看[我的个人主页！](<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nova_wostra/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nova_wostra/projects</a>)</p><p>- 彻底重制丛林神庙，提供4种不同变体<br>- 生成4个预设的沼泽僵尸<br>- 在原有战利品表基础上新增专属战利品<br>- 其中2种丛林神庙变体运用了考古系统<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/39a322cb5ff76acc88b1eb4508e5f9188fb77bc9.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/3932aa4174b49f395e39e1393f9871c3f582c2c5.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/4dd9e156769742b7019b08f2443ca34cb156ad7e.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/30df97e0c9788cb114690f3beb01eaaef96427c1.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/3ce1dd35d40ab23f86fce028c02c85f0075faf4a.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/5b46c6023261e16e5375f49e7460435872d7ed4a.png\"></p>",
